The [[Spear]] is a [[Weapon]] available in the shop for all characters, at rare rarity. It specializes in destroying {{icon/block}}, although this requires there to be empty space in front of it. The [[Spear]] can also be upgraded into the [[Poison Spear]], [[Holy Spear]], [[Molten Spear]] (if [[Flame]]s can be acquired), or [[Very Long Spear]] (if [[Twine]] can be acquired). Most of these upgrades have higher damage and allow for certain themes of items to be in the {{icon/star}} slots rather than only empty space.
